YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement and test the complete Python solution using the derived recurrence: extract events from S as each "WB" where white_count >= black_count (m=black_count before W, b=white_count including W); if S[0]=='W' or S[-1]=='B' print 0; if no events print fact[N]; otherwise compute A_i = (fact[b_i] - sum_{j<i} A_j * fact[b_i - m_j]) * invfact[b_i - m_i] mod 998244353 using CDQ divide-and-conquer with shifted NTT convolutions (direct O(left*right) for small blocks), then print (fact[N] - sum_i A_i * fact[N - m_i]) mod 998244353; include a small brute-force checker for N<=8 in development and run the provided samples.